LLD Interview Question: Design a Meeting Room Booking System

Design an in-memory meeting room booking system for an office.

Requirements
The office has multiple meeting rooms with different capacities.
A user can search for available rooms for a given time range and required capacity.
A user can book an available room.
A booking must contain:
Meeting title
Organizer
Participants
Start time
End time
Meeting room
Two meetings cannot use the same room during overlapping time periods.
A user can cancel a booking.
A user can reschedule an existing booking.
Users should be able to view:
Their bookings
A room’s schedule for a particular day
Assume everything is stored in memory.

Write executable code with a small driver program demonstrating the main flows.

